{
  "title": "Dawn of Snowstorm",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Dawn of Snowstorm</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Main_Quests\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Main Quests\">Main</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"chapter\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Chapter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chapter_I\" title=\"Chapter I\">Chapter I</a>: Act VII - <a href=\"/wiki/Thaw_of_Eons\" title=\"Thaw of Eons\">Thaw of Eons</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Description</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Time resumes and the snow clears. Mt. Firmament emerges from its long seclusion, ready to embrace its revival.</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\">Previous Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Commander_of_Time\" title=\"The Commander of Time\">The Commander of Time</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/From_the_Echoes_of_Destruction\" title=\"From the Echoes of Destruction\">From the Echoes of Destruction</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCharacters\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"characters\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jinhsi\" title=\"Jinhsi\">Jinhsi</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rover\" title=\"Rover\">Rover</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Dawn of Snowstorm</b> is the seventh act in <a href=\"/wiki/Chapter_I\" title=\"Chapter I\">Chapter I</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Quest\" title=\"Main Quest\">Main Quest</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Steps\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Navigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Navigation</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li>Leave <a href=\"/wiki/Loong%27s_Crest\" title=\"Loong&#39;s Crest\">Loong's Crest</a>\n<ul><li>Return to <a href=\"/wiki/Hongzhen\" title=\"Hongzhen\">Hongzhen</a></li>\n<li>(Optional) Ski Down the Mountain\n<ol><li>Ski to the finishing line</li></ol></li></ul></li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dd><div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-title\"><b><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"UI Quest\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/0f/UI_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20260501180345\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"UI Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"UI_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Quest Description</b></div><hr class=\"description-separator\" /><div class=\"description-content\">Time resumes and the snow clears. Mt. Firmament emerges from its long seclusion, ready to embrace its revival.</div></div></dd>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<hr />\n<dl><dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/01/Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_407_1_M.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240902194246\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_407_1_M.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_407_1_M.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d3/Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_407_1_F.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240902200101\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_407_1_F.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_407_1_F.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>\"Jué\":</b> One suggests heading back to Hongzhen to reunite with your companions, <span>(&#8205;&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Lord\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Lord</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Text for male Rover</span></span>&#8205;/<wbr />&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Lady\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Lady</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Text for female Rover</span></span>&#8205;&#8205;)</span> Arbiter.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/1/12/Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_407_2.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240902194251\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_407_2.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_407_2.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>\"Jué\":</b> With Mt. Firmament no longer posing a threat, surely Hongzhen will undergo significant changes.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(When player returns to Hongzhen)</dt>\n<dd><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/8/8f/Seq_mtfrmmq_m1_8_18_p1.png/revision/latest?cb=20240913062644\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Seq mtfrmmq m1 8 18 p1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/8/8f/Seq_mtfrmmq_m1_8_18_p1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/500?cb=20240913062644\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Seq mtfrmmq m1 8 18 p1.png\" data-image-key=\"Seq_mtfrmmq_m1_8_18_p1.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e9/Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_1.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240902194253\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_1.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_1.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Storyteller:</b> Mt. Firmament glowed with the sun's light, high above the clouds and snow. Then suddenly, they vanished, revealing a distant blue sky.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f8/Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_2.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240902194255\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_2.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_2.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Storyteller:</b> And amidst it all stood a white-haired maiden, like a goddess descended from the heavens.</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e8/Seq_mtfrmmq_m1_8_18_p2.png/revision/latest?cb=20240913062657\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Seq mtfrmmq m1 8 18 p2\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e8/Seq_mtfrmmq_m1_8_18_p2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/500?cb=20240913062657\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Seq mtfrmmq m1 8 18 p2.png\" data-image-key=\"Seq_mtfrmmq_m1_8_18_p2.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/c/c0/Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_3.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240902194256\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_3.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_3.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Storyteller:</b> With a mere wave of her hand, she brought forth a new season, transforming the streets below.</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d9/Seq_mtfrmmq_m1_8_18_p3.png/revision/latest?cb=20240913062717\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Seq mtfrmmq m1 8 18 p3\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Seq mtfrmmq m1 8 18 p3.png\" data-image-key=\"Seq_mtfrmmq_m1_8_18_p3.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d9/Seq_mtfrmmq_m1_8_18_p3.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/500?cb=20240913062717\" /></a></span></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/75/Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_4.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240902194259\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_4.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_4.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Storyteller:</b> This maiden was none other than the dead infant, now reborn as the Magistrate of Jinzhou.</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/4/42/Seq_mtfrmmq_m1_8_18_p4_M.png/revision/latest?cb=20240913062750\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Seq mtfrmmq m1 8 18 p4 M\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Seq mtfrmmq m1 8 18 p4 M.png\" data-image-key=\"Seq_mtfrmmq_m1_8_18_p4_M.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/4/42/Seq_mtfrmmq_m1_8_18_p4_M.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/250?cb=20240913062750\" /></a></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/2/2d/Seq_mtfrmmq_m1_8_18_p4_F.png/revision/latest?cb=20240913062735\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Seq mtfrmmq m1 8 18 p4 F\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Seq mtfrmmq m1 8 18 p4 F.png\" data-image-key=\"Seq_mtfrmmq_m1_8_18_p4_F.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/2/2d/Seq_mtfrmmq_m1_8_18_p4_F.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/250?cb=20240913062735\" /></a></span></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/ef/Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_5.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240902194300\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_5.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_5.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Storyteller:</b> \"When thunder roars in spring's embrace, the sun shall shine upon this place.\"</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/1/13/Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_6.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240902194301\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_6.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_6.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Storyteller:</b> \"For only through death and strife, can one truly embrace new life.\"</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/b/b5/Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_7.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240902194303\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_7.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_7.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Phrolova:</b> Hmm... I see. Doesn't matter. That's not important for our goal.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/7b/Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_8.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240902194304\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_8.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_8.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Phrolova:</b> We have the answers we wanted already.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/06/Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_9.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240902194305\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_9.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_9.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Phrolova:</b> —With the Second Resonance Awakening, we will tap into powers that rival the Sentinels... Complete control of the artificial Resonator Awakening process is within reach.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/6b/Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_11.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240902194306\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_11.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_11.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Phrolova:</b> And lastly, about that Rover...</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/8/8b/Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_12.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240902194307\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_12.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_12.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Phrolova:</b> This trip was worth it. We've collected many wonderful notes, haven't we?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/0a/Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_13.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240902194308\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_13.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_13.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Phrolova:</b> It's about time.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/3/3f/Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_14.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240902194309\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_14.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_mtfrmmq_1_1_410_14.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Phrolova:</b> Get moving. Can't let <a href=\"/wiki/Scar\" title=\"Scar\">a certain someone</a> wait too long behind bars.</dd>\n<dt>Huanglong I - Act VII <b>Thaw of Eons</b> [Quest Complete]</dt></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span cl